<view class="page">
  <view class="page-title">设置与说明</view>
  <view class="page-subtitle">数据默认保存在本机；仅在你主动识别报告、操作个人云备份或授权照护协作时使用云服务。</view>
  <view class="section-title">数据概览</view>
  <view class="stats">
    <view class="card"><text class="stat-value">{{patientCount}}</text><text>患者档案</text></view>
    <view class="card"><text class="stat-value">{{eventCount}}</text><text>病程事件</text></view>
    <view class="card"><text class="stat-value">{{reportCount}}</text><text>检验报告</text></view>
    <view class="card"><text class="stat-value">{{visitCount}}</text><text>复诊计划</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="card current"><text>当前档案</text><text class="current-value">{{activeName}}</text></view>

  <view class="section-title">个人云备份</view>
  <view class="card backup-card">
    <view class="backup-row"><text>云端状态</text><text class="backup-value">{{cloudStatusLabel}}</text></view>
    <view class="backup-row"><text>云端更新时间</text><text class="backup-value">{{cloudUpdatedLabel}}</text></view>
    <view class="backup-row"><text>本机最近备份</text><text class="backup-value">{{localBackupLabel}}</text></view>
    <text class="backup-note">每个微信身份只保留一份备份。备份包含医疗相关文字，建议只在自己的微信账号和可信设备上操作。</text>
    <view wx:if="{{hasDemoData}}" class="safe-note demo-backup-note">当前包含示例病例，云备份已禁用。删除示例病例后才能备份自己的数据。</view>
    <button class="secondary-button full-button" loading="{{cloudLoading}}" disabled="{{cloudLoading}}" bindtap="checkBackup">检查云备份</button>
    <view class="button-row">
      <button class="primary-button" disabled="{{cloudLoading || hasDemoData}}" bindtap="backup">{{hasDemoData ? '示例数据不可备份' : (cloudExists ? '覆盖备份' : '立即备份')}}</button>
      <button class="secondary-button" disabled="{{cloudLoading || !cloudExists || hasDemoData}}" bindtap="restore">{{hasDemoData ? '示例数据不可恢复' : '恢复到本机'}}</button>
    </view>
    <button wx:if="{{cloudExists}}" class="cloud-delete" disabled="{{cloudLoading}}" bindtap="deleteCloudBackup">删除云端备份</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">照护者协作</view>
  <view class="setting card" bindtap="openCareSharing">
    <view><text class="setting-title">管理只读共享授权</text><text>一次性邀请码、最小共享范围和随时撤销</text></view><view>›</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">数据与隐私</view>
  <view class="setting card" bindtap="openDataManagement">
    <view><text class="setting-title">数据与隐私管理</text><text>查看政策、撤回同意、删除本地或全部云端数据</text></view><view>›</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">体验数据</view>
  <view class="setting card" bindtap="loadDemo"><view><text class="setting-title">重新载入示例病例</text><text>不会删除你自己创建的档案</text></view><view>›</view></view>
  <view class="section-title">产品边界</view>
  <view class="card copy">
    <text class="copy-title">当前版本可以做什么</text><text>建立患者档案、整理病程和复诊摘要、个人云备份，并通过一次性邀请码建立可撤销的照护者只读授权。</text>
    <text class="copy-title later">当前版本不做什么</text><text>不解释检验指标，不提供诊断、病情判断、治疗或用药建议，也不提供公开分享链接或照护者编辑权限。</text>
  </view>
  <view class="section-title danger-title">危险操作</view>
  <button class="danger-button" bindtap="reset">清除全部本地数据</button>
  <view class="version">诊路 Phase 6 · v0.6.0</view>
</view>
